# Snippet for pay.afri-soft.com (VPS /opt/afrisoft-pay)
# Live Caddy on the VPS listens on 127.0.0.1:3000 (compose publishes payment there).
# Merge CinetPay rewrite into /etc/caddy/Caddyfile if missing, then: systemctl reload caddy
#
# Public paths registered at aggregators:
#   https://pay.afri-soft.com/webhooks/serdipay
#   https://pay.afri-soft.com/webhooks/cinetpay
# Nest payment-service global prefix is /api

# pay.afri-soft.com {
